# Load the Lavos save, walk to the exit and fight Lavos with Crono, Marle and Lucca. Outer shell: Antipode 3, Luminaire,
# Ice 2, Lightning 2, Flare, Cure 2, Slash, Mega Bomb, Delta Force, Ice Sword, Ice Sword 2, Protect, a Heal item and
# four MegaElixirs against its Laser beams, Span Death, Protective Seal, Obstacle, Shadow Slay, Flame Battle, Shadow Doom
# Blaze and Evil Emanation; the shell falls, Lucca and Marle's DNA dialogue, then the second form (Lavos Core with two
# bits): Lightning 2, Antipode 3, Crying Heavens, a knocked-out Marle revived with a Revive, Time Warp. Ends mid-battle.
